{"questions":[{"question_id":"jaoe38c1lsfjymym","content":"<p>Given below are two statements : one is labelled as Assertion A and the other is labelled as Reason R :</p>\n<p><b>Assertion A</b> : Aryl halides cannot be prepared by replacement of hydroxyl group of phenol by halogen atom.</p>\n<p><b>Reason R</b> : Phenols react with halogen acids violently.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the <b>most appropriate</b> from the options given below :</p>","chapter":"haloalkanes-and-haloarenes","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"easy","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2024-online-29th-january-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift","permalink":"pgiven-below-are-two-statements--one-is-labelled-as-asser-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-idztjcut8xfheh8r","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"<p>Given below are two statements : one is labelled as Assertion A and the other is labelled as Reason R :</p>\n<p><b>Assertion A</b> : Aryl halides cannot be prepared by replacement of hydroxyl group of phenol by halogen atom.</p>\n<p><b>Reason R</b> : Phenols react with halogen acids violently.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the <b>most appropriate</b> from the options given below :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"A is true but R is false"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Both A and R are true but R is NOT the correct explanation of A"},{"identifier":"C","content":"A is false but R is true"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>Assertion (A): Given statement is correct because in phenol hydroxyl group cannot be replaced by halogen atom.</p>\n<p>Reason (R) :</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift Chemistry - Haloalkanes and Haloarenes Question 53 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Given reason is false.</p>\n<p>Hence Assertion (A) is correct but Reason (R) is false.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>नीचे दो कथन दिए गए हे। एक को अभिकथन A और दूसरे को कारण R द्वारा दर्शाया गया हे:</p>\n<p>अभिकथन A : ऐरिल हैलाइडों को फीनॉल के हाइड्रॉक्सिल समूह के हैलोजन परमाणु द्वारा प्रतिस्थापन से बनाया नहीं जा सकता है।</p>\n<p>कारण R : फ़ीनॉल हेलोजन अम्लों के सा�� विस्फोटक रूप से अभिक्रिया करती हे। उपर दिए गए कथनों के संदर्भ में निम्नलिखित विकल्यों में से सही उत्तर चुनिए:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"A सत्य है परन्तु R असत्य है।\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"A और R दोनों सत्य हैं और R, A की सही व्याख्या नहीं है।"},{"identifier":"C","content":"A असत्य है परन्तु R सत्य है।\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"A और R दोनों सत्य हैं और R, A की सही व्याख्या है।\n"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>अभिकथन (A): दिया गया कथन सही है क्योंकि फीनॉल में हाइड्रॉक्सिल समूह को हैलोजन परमाणु द्वारा प्रतिस्थापित नहीं किया जा सकता है।</p>\n<p>कारण (R) :</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift Chemistry - Haloalkanes and Haloarenes Question 53 Hindi Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lt2i